    "urpx:description": "Pattern-demonstration slice of PG&E E-TOU-D — only the TOU schedule + energy rates are modeled, to illustrate the URPX pattern for 'peak applies on weekdays EXCLUDING holidays' using urpx:includeHolidays / urpx:includeNonHolidays on TimeBracket. The full E-TOU-D conversion (income tiers, baseline credit, vintage PCIA, full unbundled rates) is tracked in urpx-tariffs (URPXT-mdk).",
